                },
                "schema": {
                  "description": "An error response, following RFC 9457 (Problem Details for HTTP APIs, which obsoletes RFC 7807). Returned with `Content-Type: application/problem+json` on every 4xx/5xx response. The HTTP status line carries the status code; it is intentionally not repeated in the body. `type`, `title` and `instance` are always present; `detail` is included when a specific explanation is available.\n",
                  "properties": {
